    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Cash Buyers Only\nThe Property Shop are delighted to present this excellent two bedroom ground floor apartment to the market. Dunboyne Castle is excellently located only a short stroll of the beautiful village of Dunboyne offering a host of local amenities and transport links with easy access to the M3/M50 road network. The Blanchardstown Town Centre is only a short drive with Dublin City Centre also easily accessible. The spacious accommodation comprises entrance hall with hot press, bright and spacious open plan kitchen/living/dining, two double bedrooms and a bathroom. This property is sure to suit both investors and owner occupiers alike. Viewing is highly recommended and is by appointment only through The Property Shop on 01 825 5222."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE HALL\nFreshly tiled entrance hall with hot press.\n\nLIVING / DINING AREA - 7.59m (24'11\") x 3.71m (12'2\") : 28.16 sqm (303 sqft)\nBright and spacious with feature fireplace with electric fire and large windows providing plenty of natural light. Access to patio area overlooking green open space with a sunny east facing aspect.\n\nKITCHEN - 2.73m (8'11\") x 2.24m (7'4\") : 6.12 sqm (66 sqft)\nOpen-plan kitchen featuring a tiled splash back with a stylish subway-effect finish, a range of eye and low level storage units and tiled flooring.\n\n\nBEDROOM - 3.04m (10'0\") x 3.02m (9'11\") : 9.18 sqm (99 sqft)\nBright bedroom with a private view, built-in storage and newly fitted laminate flooring.\n\n\nBEDROOM - 3.08m (10'1\") x 2.91m (9'7\") : 8.96 sqm (96 sqft)\nDouble bedroom with ample built-in storage and new laminate flooring.\n\n\nBATHROOM - 2.25m (7'5\") x 2.04m (6'8\") : 4.59 sqm (49 sqft)\nRecently tiled bathroom, partially tiled with a splashback to the wash hand basin. Features a WC, full-size bathtub with shower over, and a practical, modern finish.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Two bedroom ground floor apartment </li><li> Short stroll of Dunboyne Village </li><li> Excellent condition throughout </li><li> Electric heating </li><li> Double glazed windows </li><li> Ample parking</li></ul>"
      },
